uilt to survive the cold and carry survivors across a frozen Earth. Scattered pockets of humanity cling to life in small, isolated communities, and most stops you make will offer the chance to bring new people aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On its steel tracks, you will carve a path across a frozen Earth, adapting your mobile city to meet the needs of those who call it home. Explore a handcrafted world and follow a gripping, linear narrative as you chase warmth, safety, and the faint promise of a future at the end of the line. Somewhere out there lies the key to a lasting refuge, hidden away and waiting to be found.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras/589f9b20aaa48741789940ebd54cad90.avif?t=1765499871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras_big/589f9b20aaa48741789940ebd54cad90.webp?t=1765499871 width=1600 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras/29183af51af13a3ef7fa7372ea51a34c.poster.avif?t=1765499871\" width=620 height=177 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras/29183af51af13a3ef7fa7372ea51a34c.webm?t=1765499871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your train into a thriving city on rails. Use the Factory to build new carriages, then fill them with essential facilities to keep your passengers alive, produce vital resources, and research breakthrough technologies. Place your buildings wisely, as facilities gain powerful adjacency bonuses that make your Frostliner stronger and more efficient the longer it grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras/72d9f7d3b9d41b1c0a5d1dd33ab24668.avif?t=1765499871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras_big/72d9f7d3b9d41b1c0a5d1dd33ab24668.webp?t=1765499871 width=1600 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras/50694884595b65ddbce8a60699772823.poster.avif?t=1765499871\" width=620 height=177 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras/50694884595b65ddbce8a60699772823.webm?t=1765499871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The engine hungers. To keep moving, you must stop and scavenge for fuel, supplies, and survivors. But when the train stops, the heat dies, leaving you with only your limited reserve batteries to fend off the killing frost. Every halt is a race against time, and every stop is a choice between safety and risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras/c762f7752cdfbf0f2525c001998ab759.avif?t=1765499871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras_big/c762f7752cdfbf0f2525c001998ab759.webp?t=1765499871 width=1600 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681260/extras/7824aaa7e515a1de96992bdc7a9d9734.poster.avif?t=1765499871\" width=620 height=177 ><source src=